This crate is a Rust port of the A2UI Express inference format from the A2UI
agent SDK (https://github.com/a2ui-project/a2ui), Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its design follows the
TypeScript implementation in typescript/agents/a2ui_agent.

vendor/a2ui/ holds unmodified files from that repository (the Express
conformance suite, test catalogs, protocol schemas, the basic catalog and the
Express grammar). They keep their original copyright headers; the upstream
license is at vendor/a2ui/LICENSE and the pinned commit at vendor/a2ui/UPSTREAM.

